{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-js","path":"/blog/2024-10-28-how-to-change-svg-size-in-react-js/","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"excerpt":"Hi Friends 👋, Welcome To aHoisting! To change svg size in react js, you can set  in . It will change svg size in react js. Today, I am going to show you, how…","html":"<p>Hi Friends 👋,</p>\n<p>Welcome To aHoisting!</p>\n<p>To change svg size in react js, you can set <code class=\"language-text\">width=\"100\" height=\"100\"</code> in <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;svg></code>. It will change svg size in react js.</p>\n<p>Today, I am going to show you, how to change svg size in react js.</p>\n<p>Table of contents</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Install and create a new React app.</li>\n<li>Import react component.</li>\n<li>Create a Component.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Let’s start with the first step.</p>\n<h2>Step 1: Install and create a new React app.</h2>\n<p>First you have to install the React project. You should use <code class=\"language-text\">create-react-app</code> command to create a new React project.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\">npx create<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>react<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>app my<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>app\ncd my<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>app\nnpm start</code></pre></div>\n<h2>Step 2: Import react component.</h2>\n<p>After installing, you have to import your React component.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> React <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"react\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<h2>Step 3: Create a Component.</h2>\n<p>You can use <code class=\"language-text\">width=\"100\" height=\"100\"</code> to change svg size in react js.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>svg width<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"100\"</span> height<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"100\"</span> viewBox<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"0 0 24 24\"</span> fill<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"none\"</span> xmlns<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n  <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>circle cx<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"12\"</span> cy<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"12\"</span> r<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"10\"</span> strokeWidth<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"2\"</span> stroke<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"yellow\"</span> fill<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"red\"</span> <span class=\"token operator\">/</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>svg<span class=\"token operator\">></span></code></pre></div>\n<h2>change svg size example.</h2>\n<p>The below code is an example of a React. You have to import <code class=\"language-text\">react</code> and set <code class=\"language-text\">width=\"100\" height=\"100\"</code> in <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;svg></code> to change svg size in react js.</p>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">App.js</code></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> React <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"react\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token function-variable function\">App</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>svg width<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"100\"</span> height<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"100\"</span> viewBox<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"0 0 24 24\"</span> fill<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"none\"</span> xmlns<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>circle cx<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"12\"</span> cy<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"12\"</span> r<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"10\"</span> strokeWidth<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"2\"</span> stroke<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"yellow\"</span> fill<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"red\"</span> <span class=\"token operator\">/</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n    <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>svg<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">default</span> App<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>In the above code example, I have used the <code class=\"language-text\">width=\"100\" height=\"100\"</code> to change svg size in react js.</p>\n<p>Check the output of the above code.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 365px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/8ce071410a17d6335e6a42a75b105e89/25243/svg-size.webp\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 84.81012658227847%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/webp;base64,UklGRmQAAABXRUJQVlA4IFgAAABQAwCdASoUABEAPtFWpk0oJCOiMBgIAQAaCUAABc434pI49ADyp7cSAZ/jlPUXM+Xm68KqpsNYy5zX3tMU/DNI9pJdGdvqc/J1Xu+wJ6bX8qCLEbvtRcAA'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"React, svg, size\"\n        title=\"React, svg, size\"\n        src=\"/static/8ce071410a17d6335e6a42a75b105e89/25243/svg-size.webp\"\n        srcset=\"/static/8ce071410a17d6335e6a42a75b105e89/81b7c/svg-size.webp 158w,\n/static/8ce071410a17d6335e6a42a75b105e89/6ea66/svg-size.webp 315w,\n/static/8ce071410a17d6335e6a42a75b105e89/25243/svg-size.webp 365w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 365px) 100vw, 365px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>All the best 👍</p>","frontmatter":{"title":"How to change svg size in React js?","tags":["React"],"date":"October 28, 2024","description":"Example of change svg size in react js with step by step tutorial - aHoisting","social_image":{"absolutePath":"/Users/mac/Documents/hoisting/ahoisting/static/media/template/reactjs.jpg"}}},"prev":{"frontmatter":{"title":"How to change svg color in react js?"},"fields":{"slug":"/blog/2024-10-28-how-to-change-svg-color-in-react-js/"}},"next":{"frontmatter":{"title":"How to change submit button size in react js?"},"fields":{"slug":"/blog/2024-10-27-how-to-change-submit-button-size-in-react-js/"}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/blog/2024-10-28-how-to-change-svg-size-in-react-js/","prevSlug":"/blog/2024-10-28-how-to-change-svg-color-in-react-js/","nextSlug":"/blog/2024-10-27-how-to-change-submit-button-size-in-react-js/"}},"staticQueryHashes":["2555585279","2714594843","3159585216"]}